cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use picorna-strm, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "picorna-strm: reference-based assembly and VP1 genotyping of picornavirus genomes"
abstract: >-
  A Nextflow pipeline for reference-based consensus assembly of picornavirus
  genomes from short-read sequencing, with optional VP1 genotyping, adapted
  for the genetic diversity of picornaviruses.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/greninger-lab/picorna-strm"
authors:
